00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:55.840
still worry they still don't know if what they&nbsp;
have created is anything that's worthy of being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.960 --> 00:12:02.240
seen or shown or read so I do feel as though&nbsp;
there's a there's you got to close that gap&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:10.000
someplace and luckily I had I had a whole team of&nbsp;
people who were willing to help me close that gap&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:14.720
does Lily want to be a writer creative you know&nbsp;
I keep asking Lily if she would if she would do&nbsp;&nbsp;

